# files of the shared cmake layer: <file> <projects>
#
# <projects> is * (every qjs-* project that has a cmake/ directory) or a space separated
# list. A file with a copy in this directory is canonical: scripts/cmake-sync.sh makes the
# projects match it. A listed file without a copy here is unreconciled: the script only
# reports how its copies differ (see "Reconciling a file" in doc/cmake.md).
#
# layout per project: cmake/<file>, or cmake/deps/<file> when the project has cmake/deps/
# (its Find*/Build* dependency scripts live there).

FindQuickJS.cmake       *
BuildQuickJS.cmake      *
qjsm.cmake              qjs-modules
QuickJSModule.cmake     *
Functions.cmake         *
Checks.cmake            *
Compat.cmake            *
UseMultiArch.cmake      *
